Package: ontologySpecR
Title: Core Type System and Interchange Format for Ontology-Based R Packages
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Cathal", "Byrne", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "cathalbyrne@example.com")
Description: Defines canonical S3 classes and JSON Schema for ontology
    primitives: object types, link types, interfaces, action types, and
    queries. Provides a shared intermediate representation (IR) so that
    downstream packages (objectTypesR, linkTypesR, objectSetsR, etc.) can
    interoperate without tight coupling. Bundles can be serialized to/from
    JSON for distribution, validation, and API interchange.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/CathalByrneGit/ontologySpecR
